{
  "id": "flash-cut",
  "abi": "8",
  "name": "快闪卡点",
  "keywords": [
    "快闪",
    "卡点",
    "快切",
    "短句",
    "节奏",
    "冲击",
    "大字"
  ],
  "when": "需要三到五个短句用硬切与大字连打、不铺陈只给结论时",
  "blocks": [
    "scene.code"
  ],
  "style": {
    "fonts": {
      "display": "sans-900",
      "body": "sans-400",
      "num": "latin-700"
    },
    "colors": {
      "bg": "#0A0A0C",
      "ink": "#F5F2EA",
      "muted": "#8E8878",
      "accent": "#D9A441",
      "line": "#26262C"
    },
    "backgrounds": {
      "night": "#0A0A0C",
      "smoke": "#17181C",
      "charcoal": "#17181C"
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "safeMargin": 0.05,
    "scale": {
      "title": 1.6,
      "label": 0.7,
      "note": 0.45
    },
    "stroke": [
      2,
      7
    ],
    "forbid": [
      "把短句写进 block 的题材枚举参数；每句来自 storyboard 的 narration 与 code",
      "在快闪里再叠一层字幕；画面文字即正文，字幕必须 none",
      "单场超过 2.4s；超过就不是快切而是讲解",
      "同一场出现两种字号相近的标题；阶梯必须拉开",
      "连续两场用 dip-to-color 假装叠化；同色 dip 只能成对用一次"
    ]
  },
  "captions": {
    "style": "none"
  },
  "audio": {
    "mood": "cut",
    "volume": 0.11,
    "fadeIn": 1,
    "fadeOut": 1.8,
    "duck": {
      "level": 0.05,
      "edge": 0.12
    }
  },
  "verify": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "assert": "ink.insideSafe",
      "args": {
        "margin": 0.05
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "element.count.gte",
      "args": {
        "n": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "caption.noOverlapSubject",
      "args": {}
    }
  ]
}
